<title>POLAND: AGROS JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>AGROS JULY NET RISES TO PLN 2.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY		     1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.07 vs   0.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.78 vs   0.96</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.86 vs   0.98</p>
